      "content": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: var(--text-color, #333); background-color: var(--bg-color, #fafafa); padding: 12px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n    <h4 style=\"color: var(--heading-color, #4db6ac);\">What this table shows:</h4>\n    <p>\n        This table displays <span style=\"color: var(--highlight-color, #81c784); font-weight:bold;\">regression execution status</span> by team, including test case counts for each team. It breaks down execution type (manual or automated), giving a clear view of progress and coverage.\n    </p>\n\n    <h4 style=\"color: var(--heading-color, #4db6ac);\">Why it matters:</h4>\n    <p>\n        It provides visibility into how regression efforts are distributed across teams and how close the team is to finzalize thier commitments.\n    </p>\n\n    <h4 style=\"color: var(--heading-color, #4db6ac);\">How to interpret:</h4>\n    <p>\n        Since we follow a <span style=\"color: var(--warning-color, #ffb74d); font-weight:bold;\">risk-based testing approach</span>, execution dynamic may vary by team. High-risk areas often needs more effort and may still require manual validation.\n    </p>\n\n</div>\n",
